.env
compose.override.yaml
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The JSON files are the spec, and the
# acceptance criterion is "run the updater, review the log, commit". Runtime
# artefacts the updater produces are listed individually instead.
data/*.tmp
data/updater.log
# Machine-owned and regenerable: 13 series, ~2900 observations, rewritten
# wholesale every run. Tracking it would bury every real edit to the spec.
data/series.json
data/updater-state.json
